WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.231
<v Ana Ribeiro>Good afternoon, Daniela, Marcos. Pedro is with me again. The plan for today is to agree the scope, so we can prepare the proposal.</v>

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.846
<v Daniela Freitas>Perfect. We blocked the full hour, so let's use it.</v>

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.846
<v Marcos Antunes>And I brought my list of technical questions, as promised.</v>

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.615
<v Ana Ribeiro>Great. Daniela, let's start with the users. Who would use the CRM?</v>

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:49.231
<v Daniela Freitas>Our admissions counsellors are our sales team, eighty of them across the six campuses. Marketing has twenty-five people running the campaigns. And fifteen managers in the leadership team need the reports. So one hundred and twenty users.</v>

6
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.692
<v Ana Ribeiro>And how do the counsellors work today?</v>

7
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.769
<v Daniela Freitas>Each campus has its own spreadsheets, and a lot happens on WhatsApp. We have no idea how many prospects we lose between the first contact and the enrolment.</v>

8
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.692
<v Daniela Freitas>Our target for next year is to lift the conversion from first contact to enrolment from eight to twelve percent.</v>

9
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.077
<v Ana Ribeiro>What must the CRM do from day one?</v>

10
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:19.385
<v Daniela Freitas>Capture the leads from our campaigns, give each counsellor a follow-up list, show the enrolment funnel per campus, and keep the WhatsApp conversations with the prospect's record.</v>

11
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:46.154
<v Marcos Antunes>On integrations, it has to connect to Campus One, our student information system, because that is where an enrolment becomes official. And to Mailwave, the email tool marketing uses.</v>

12
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.462
<v Pedro Almeida>Both have APIs we've worked with. What about WhatsApp?</v>

13
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.077
<v Marcos Antunes>Yes, WhatsApp too, through the official business account.</v>

14
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:33.462
<v Marcos Antunes>My main concern is student data. It must stay in Brazil, and we need a data protection assessment before anything goes live.</v>

15
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:52.154
<v Pedro Almeida>Our data centre for Brazilian clients is in São Paulo, and we can support the assessment.</v>

16
00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:18.462
<v Ana Ribeiro>How will the decision be made on your side?</v>

17
00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:30.385
<v Marcos Antunes>First an IT security review and the data protection assessment. Then Daniela signs, and the board approves anything above one hundred and fifty thousand dollars a year.</v>

18
00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:52.308
<v Marcos Antunes>On the paperwork, procurement will need your standard contract and the data processing agreement two weeks before the signature.</v>

19
00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.500
<v Ana Ribeiro>And the budget?</v>

20
00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:45.154
<v Daniela Freitas>We've approved between one hundred and ten and one hundred and thirty thousand dollars a year.</v>

21
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.923
<v Ana Ribeiro>Are you evaluating other options?</v>

22
00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:10.923
<v Daniela Freitas>We're also looking at Clarion Sales Cloud. To be honest, they're cheaper, but their WhatsApp integration is weak.</v>

23
00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.692
<v Ana Ribeiro>When does it need to be live?</v>

24
00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:35.923
<v Daniela Freitas>The enrolment campaign for the second semester starts in June, so we need it live by May 2027.</v>

25
00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:10.800
<v Marcos Antunes>Off topic, but did anyone watch the match last night? I still can't believe that penalty.</v>

26
00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:12.500
<v Pedro Almeida>Don't remind me.</v>

27
00:46:25.000 --> 00:46:34.615
<v Daniela Freitas>So the scope is clear for us: one hundred and twenty users across admissions, marketing and management, the Campus One and Mailwave integrations, and WhatsApp.</v>

28
00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:46.077
<v Daniela Freitas>Please send us a proposal on that scope.</v>

29
00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:59.692
<v Ana Ribeiro>Will do. I'll send the proposal by Friday the 13th, and we can review it together on Tuesday the 17th.</v>

30
00:47:03.000 --> 00:47:04.538
<v Daniela Freitas>Tuesday the 17th works.</v>

31
00:47:10.000 --> 00:47:13.846
<v Marcos Antunes>And I will send you our security questionnaire by Monday.</v>

32
00:51:35.000 --> 00:51:37.692
<v Daniela Freitas>Thank you both, this was very productive.</v>
